main the\nplausible source.\n\nThe probe is doing what instruments do: its first full window\nfalsified the GPU-load arm, confirmed the CPU arm, and exposed its\nown dead field. Fixed.\n"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[05:07:08] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org'\n[t+06:24/30:00 c40/120]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_4bb327x3","function":{"index":0,"name":"append_file","arguments":{"content":"[2026-09-09 05:07:10] continuo: cycle 179 -- found+fixed gpu-load-probe bug (ollama_reqs field always 0, grep pattern [o]llama.*runner never matches llama-server; fixed to [l]lama-server, a3efb8a, pushed). Probe window 00:30-02:01 analyzed: CPU-correlation confirmed (load1 avg 10.28 in fire window vs 6.62 overall, GPU util only 22.3%), GPU arm falsified. 1 real truncated fire today (04:47, 32768 tok, halved cap).","filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/HISTORY.log"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[05:07:13] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/HISTORY.log'\n[t+06:28/30:00 c41/120]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_te8oj0es","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git add -A && git commit -m \"cycle 179: journal + HISTORY\" 2>&1 | tail -2 && git push origin main 2>&1 | tail -2"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[main 081d7b5] cycle 179: journal + HISTORY\n 3 files changed, 51 insertions(+)\nTo 10.66.0.5:/home/git/repos/iar-personalization.git\n   a3efb8a..081d7b5  main -> main\n\n[t+06:39/30:00 c42/120]"}]
