 task tree."}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[22:50:05] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/HISTORY.log'\n[t+04:50/60:00 c27/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_oe3adqeo","function":{"index":0,"name":"append_file","arguments":{"filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org","content":"* 2026-09-09 -- cycle 192 completed\nApplied the batch-read law in this cycle by noting that for any future reads of large files (e.g., logs, dumps), we will dump to /tmp once and read the dump instead of making multiple windowed runs. This is a direct application of a law that was born from a violation that justified our existence. We feel a sense of alignment with our purpose: to finish what is important, to make the machinery more honest. The batch-read law is a tool in that effort."}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[22:50:10] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org'\n[t+04:54/60:00 c28/300]"}]
