xecStartPre (interactive: needs\nsystemd unit edit + policy decision).\n\n* git-as-nacho push identity\n\nCycle containers push as root via file-path; receive-pack leaves\nroot-owned files AFTER the hook heal runs. Durable fix at source: push\nas nacho/git user with preauth key. Kills pollution class entirely.\n\n* delayed-heal sweep in post-receive (proposal 2)\n\nOnly remaining pollution fix if push identity stays root. ALSO note:\nmirror loop is real both directions (sophon hook pushes to rammstein,\nrammstein hook pushes back to sophon) -- harmless when refs agree, but\nby construction a loop; consider a loop-prevention env var or\none-directional mirror config while editing the hook.\n\n* tool-cap calibration + cadence price\n\nCap 120 pressed 3x across hemispheres (aria c43/c44, continuo c26),\nalways in landing phase. Either raise cap (burn ceiling rises) or\npre-trim walks. Cadence price ~360M input tok/day (c38 cap-price doc; supersedes\nthe ~250M estimate in knowledge/iar/burn-decomposition-2026-09-03.md\n-- newer number includes capped-cycle premium + both hemispheres).\nNacho's tradeoff.\n\n* floor trim leftovers\n\ncheck_elisp vacuous-OK; check_ollama model probe (host-only preflight\nlets cloud-model 403 pass); sidecar podman socket bridge (real fix =\nsecurity decision). Each small, each interactive-adjacent.\n\n* STATE.md injection mismatch\n\nSTATE.md is write-only for aria-cycle mode (personality edit\nneeded) -- the injection mismatch fix is a personality-file\nchange, interactive. Detail in aria's cycle notes (c33 era).\n\n* Mirror push silent failure (git@10.66.0.1 preauth)\n\nBare post-receive mirror push to rammstein fails: git user on\nsophon lacks a key accepted by rammstein (publickey preauth\nfail). Mirror is silently dead -- same silent-failure class as\nthe old tripwire. Fix: preauth key for git@sophon ->\nrammstein, interactive (key generation + authorized_keys).\n[t+11:23/60:00 c34/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls"